### Server testen
GET http://localhost:3000

### Session erstellen
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions

### Sessions anzeigen
GET http://localhost:3000/sessions

### Einzelne Session anzeigen
# ID ersetzen
GET http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID

### Beitreten
# SESSION_ID ersetzen
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vincent"
}

### Vote abgeben
# SESSION_ID und PARTICIPANT_ID ersetzen
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantId": "PARTICIPANT_ID",
  "vote": "5"
}

### Aufdecken
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID/reveal

### Reset
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID/reset

### Deck wechseln
PUT http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID/deck
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deck": "tshirt"
}

### Heartbeat
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantId": "PARTICIPANT_ID"
}

### Verlassen
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID/leave
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantId": "PARTICIPANT_ID"
}

### Session löschen
DELETE http://localhost:3000/sessions/SESSION_ID
